  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, frequency of sound produced by sources <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p><p>Speed of sound in air, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>340</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Apparent frequency heard by the observer when source <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is moving towards him,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>'</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>340</mn><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>400</mn></math></p><p>Apparent frequency heard by the observer when source <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is moving away from him,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>'</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>340</mn><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>400</mn></math></p><p>Given, Beats&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>'</mo></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>'</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>340</mn><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>340</mn><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>34000</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>340</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>34000</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><msup><mn>340</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mn>340</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
